*
!private/
!public/
!.gitignore

# Published boundary data — CCMC's 2024 ward export, Greater Chennai
# Corporation's wards, and Tamil Nadu's revenue districts.
#
# This is reference data the app is built on, not user content: ward routing is
# point-in-polygon against these files, and without them every report resolves
# to no ward at all. It only lives under storage/ because that is where the
# import commands read from, and Laravel's blanket ignore here is meant for
# uploads. Versioning it is what makes a rebuild reproduce — 1.9 MB is a cheap
# price for a deployment that does not depend on one laptop.
!geo/
!geo/**
